          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The complete request must load before you can allow it."
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "The estimate reserves an allowance; it is not a guarantee of the provider’s final charge.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "估價用來預留額度，並不保證是服務商最終收取的金額。"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "見積額は利用枠の仮確保に使います。プロバイダーの最終的な請求額を保証するものではありません。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The estimate reserves an allowance; it is not a guarantee of the provider’s final charge."
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "The full key cannot be viewed or exported.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "完整 key 無法檢視或匯出。"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "キー全体を表示したり、書き出したりすることはできません。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The full key cannot be viewed or exported."
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "The key will only be saved after you review and confirm it here.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你在這裡審閱並確認後，才會儲存 key。"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ここで確認してから、キーが保存されます。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The key will only be saved after you review and confirm it here."
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "The provider may have processed and charged for this request. It will not be retried automatically.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "服務商可能已處理這個請求並收費。系統不會自動重試。"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "プロバイダーがこのリクエストを処理し、課金している可能性があります。自動では再試行しません。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The provider may have processed and charged for this request. It will not be retried automatically."
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "The setup link will stay here while you sign in.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "登入期間會保留設定連結。"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ログイン中も設定リンクは保持されます。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The setup link will stay here while you sign in."
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "This can skip the review sheet. Someone holding your unlocked phone could approve spending when device verification is off. Only a loaded request with an estimate of $0.05 or less can be allowed, for this call only. Estimates are not guaranteed final charges.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此功能可以略過審閱頁。若未啟用裝置驗證，持有已解鎖手機的人可能批准支出。僅限已載入、估價不超過 $0.05 的請求，而且只批准這一次。估價並不保證是最終費用。"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "確認画面を省略できます。本人確認をオフにしていると、ロック解除済みの iPhone を持つ人が支出を許可できてしまいます。読み込み済みで見積額が $0.05 以下のリクエストを、今回限り許可できます。見積額は最終的な請求額を保証しません。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This can skip the review sheet. Someone holding your unlocked phone could approve spending when device verification is off. Only a loaded request with an estimate of $0.05 or less can be allowed, for this call only. Estimates are not guaranteed final charges."
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "This replaces your saved %@ key ending %@.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "這會替換已儲存、末四碼為 %2$@ 的 %1$@ key。"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "保存済みの %1$@ キー（末尾 %2$@）を置き換えます。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This replaces your saved %@ key ending %@."
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "This setup has expired. Start a new setup on your computer.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "這次設定已過期。請在電腦上開始新的設定。"
