            "value": "アカウントを確認中…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Keyala is an experimental personal project operated by Joseph Chen. I am actively developing and testing it, but cannot promise uninterrupted service or immediate support. Contact support@keyala.io with questions.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Keyala is an experimental personal project operated by Joseph Chen. I am actively developing and testing it, but cannot promise uninterrupted service or immediate support. Contact support@keyala.io with questions."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Keyala 是 Joseph Chen 個人營運的實驗性專案。我持續認真開發與測試，但無法保證服務不中斷或立即回覆。問題可寄至 support@keyala.io。"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Keyala は Joseph Chen が個人で運営する実験的なプロジェクトです。開発と検証を続けていますが、常時稼働や即時対応は保証できません。ご質問は support@keyala.io へお送りください。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Delete your Keyala account in Settings > Account. You must confirm and verify your identity again. Stored keys, permissions and request history are removed from the live service. Older backups may retain data until they expire; deletion records must be replayed before a restored database is used.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Delete your Keyala account in Settings > Account. You must confirm and verify your identity again. Stored keys, permissions and request history are removed from the live service. Older backups may retain data until they expire; deletion records must be replayed before a restored database is used."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在「設定 > 帳號」可刪除 Keyala 帳號，須確認並再次驗證身分。線上服務會移除保存的金鑰、授權及請求歷史。舊備份可能在到期前保有資料；使用還原的資料庫前須重播刪除紀錄。"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "「設定 > アカウント」で削除できます。確認と再度の本人確認が必要です。稼働中のサービスからキー、許可、リクエスト履歴を削除します。古いバックアップには期限までデータが残る場合があり、復旧時には削除記録を反映する必要があります。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Lost phone or leaked access": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Lost phone or leaked access"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "遺失手機或存取權外洩"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "端末の紛失やアクセス情報の漏えい"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "On another iPhone, sign in to the same Keyala account. In Settings > Account, sign out other devices and stop all app permissions. Revoke a leaked provider key at the provider too; removing it from Keyala does not revoke it there.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "On another iPhone, sign in to the same Keyala account. In Settings > Account, sign out other devices and stop all app permissions. Revoke a leaked provider key at the provider too; removing it from Keyala does not revoke it there."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在另一支 iPhone 登入相同 Keyala 帳號，於「設定 > 帳號」登出其他裝置並停止所有 App 授權。外洩的金鑰也須到服務商撤銷；從 Keyala 移除不會撤銷服務商端的金鑰。"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "別の iPhone で同じ Keyala アカウントにログインし、「設定 > アカウント」で他の端末からログアウトして、すべてのアプリの許可を停止してください。漏えいしたキーはプロバイダー側でも失効させてください。Keyala からの削除だけでは失効しません。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Identity verification failed. Verify the same account again; your account was not deleted.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Identity verification failed. Verify the same account again; your account was not deleted."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "身分驗證失敗。請再次驗證同一帳號；帳號尚未刪除。"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "本人確認に失敗しました。同じアカウントでもう一度確認してください。アカウントは削除されていません。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A request is being sent. Wait for it to finish, then try account deletion again.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A request is being sent. Wait for it to finish, then try account deletion again."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "正在轉送請求。請等處理結束後再嘗試刪除帳號。"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "リクエストを送信中です。終了してからアカウント削除をやり直してください。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The operator has paused provider requests. Check support for the service status.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The operator has paused provider requests. Check support for the service status."
